  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8005.04 Display of License. All license holders shall carry the pocket card when acting in the course of his or her trade and shall display the pocket card upon request of an inspector or customer.\n\nSource. #8954, eff 7-21-07",
